; @checkout-kit packages live in GitHub Packages, not on npmjs.com. This line makes
; `npm publish` and `npm install` look in the right place for that scope only; everything
; else still comes from the public registry.
;
; Publishing needs a token with `write:packages` in NPM_TOKEN, installing one with
; `read:packages`. See RELEASING.md.
@checkout-kit:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
